---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Cookie Policy — REBELVAULT"
  description="Cookie Policy for REBELVAULT."
>
  <section class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-inner">

      <div class="eyebrow">
        REBELVAULT
      </div>

      <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>

      <p class="legal-intro">
        This page explains how cookies and similar technologies may be
        used when you visit REBELVAULT.
      </p>

      <div class="legal-meta">
        Last updated: September 2026
      </div>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>1. What Are Cookies?</h2>

        <p>
          Cookies are small files or pieces of information stored by a
          website or third-party service on a visitor's device. They can
          help websites remember settings, maintain functionality,
          measure traffic or provide advertising.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>2. How REBELVAULT May Use Cookies</h2>

        <p>
          Cookies or similar technologies may be used for essential
          website functionality, security, preferences, analytics,
          advertising and measurement.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>3. Third-Party Cookies</h2>

        <p>
          Third-party services displayed or used by REBELVAULT may place
          their own cookies or use similar technologies.
        </p>

        <p>
          This may include advertising services, embedded video providers,
          analytics systems or other external services.
        </p>

        <p>
          These third parties operate according to their own privacy
          policies and terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>4. Managing Cookies</h2>

        <p>
          Most modern browsers allow you to view, block, delete or
          restrict cookies through browser settings.
        </p>

        <p>
          Blocking cookies may affect certain functions or experiences on
          REBELVAULT and on third-party services accessed through the
          website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>5. Embedded Content</h2>

        <p>
          When an embedded video player or other third-party component is
          loaded, that provider may process information according to its
          own technology and policies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>6. Changes to This Policy</h2>

        <p>
          This Cookie Policy may be updated when the website or its
          third-party services change. The latest version will always be
          published on this page.
        </p>
      </section>

      <a href="/" class="legal-back">
        ← BACK TO REBELVAULT
      </a>

    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .legal-page {
      padding: 90px 24px 110px;
    }

    .legal-inner {
      width: min(850px, 100%);
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .legal-inner h1 {
      margin: 14px 0 24px;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 72px);
      line-height: 0.98;
      letter-spacing: -3px;
    }

    .legal-intro {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0;
      color: #b4bac3;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .legal-meta {
      margin-top: 18px;
      color: #666c75;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .legal-section {
      margin-top: 52px;
    }

    .legal-section h2 {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .legal-section p {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      color: #9da3ad;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.85;
    }

    .legal-back {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 52px;
      color: #ff4938;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 1.2px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .legal-back:hover {
      color: #fff;
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
